<title>HONG KONG: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on basket of financials.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on basket of financials.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said Thursday it proposed the issue of 42 million American-style call warrants on a basket of five financial sector stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket is comprises:</p>
<p> Dah Sing Financial Holdings Ltd	  0.5 shares</p>
<p> Dao Heng Bank Group Ltd		    0.5 shares</p>
<p> FPB Bank Holding Co Ltd		    4.0 shares</p>
<p> JCG Holdings Ltd			     1.0 shares</p>
<p> Wing Hang Bank Ltd			   0.5 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$53.10     PREMIUM	 8.9 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.9182    GEARING	 3.46x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  23.OCT.97    PAYDATE	 11.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  20,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$66.375</p>
<p>NOTE: GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
